rtifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"title\":\"Three-Statement Forecast\",\"description\":\"Create a spreadsheet using the Three-Statement Forecast template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Three-Statement Forecast. Build an integrated income statement, balance sheet, and cash flow forecast with assumptions, checks, and an executive summary.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2c8191ab4516ba7697f480\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_32dba5a7095c8191adca04ee30276304/agents\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_32dba5a7095c8191adca04ee30276304/agents\",\"title\":\"Agents\",\"description\":\"Build agent apps with the Agents API or Agents SDK. Use when adding tools, sessions, sandboxes, handoffs, guardrails, evals, or deployment.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_32dba5a7095c8191adca04ee30276304\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-developers\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6aa44ebb14088191bb483740fbcac531\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_7c2825b8f3a4819196fb6231cb394c5a\",\"skill_name\":\"agents\",\"contents\":[\"references\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_32dba5a7095c8191adca04ee30276304/devday-guide\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_32dba5a7095c8191adca04ee30276304/devday-guide\",\"title\":\"DevDay Guide\",\"description\":\"Help with OpenAI DevDay attendance, onsite logistics, session schedules, personal plans, livestreams, recordings, and DevDay Exchanges. Use for DevDay-specific questions, not general OpenAI API or app development