tion states plus sixteen look directions. Preserve Library artifacts and Pets MCP lifecycle behavior. Exclude real pets, standalone images, and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573a53888191b6f2c38c1a8ad4ca\",\"skill_name\":\"create-pet\",\"contents\":[\"references\",\"scripts\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"title\":\"Pets\",\"description\":\"List, inspect, select, download, or delete animated pets in ChatGPT Work mode. Use for an explicit pet in ChatGPT or established ChatGPT Pets context. Exclude real-world and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573ba8bc819186e79bd4858c707b\",\"skill_name\":\"pets\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/update-pet\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/update-pet\",\"title\":\"Update pet\",\"description\":\"Inspect, validate, preview, repair, or update a custom pet in ChatGPT Work mode, including its name, description, or sprite sheet. Use for a pet in ChatGPT or established ChatGPT Pets context. Exclude real-world and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573d52608191b967e6759086094c\",\"skill_name\":\"update-pet\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_b3438d6beb9081918fba3625bc988128/plugin-management\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_b3438d6beb9081918fba3625bc988128/plugin-management\",\"title\":\"plugin-management\",\"description\":\"Discover and suggest relevant plugins, inspect app permissions and dependencies, and manage plugin connections or removal. Use when the user asks about plugins or when a task would materially benefit from an external app, account, service, or data source that available tools cannot access.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_b3438d6beb9081918fba3625bc988128\",\"plugin_name\":\"plugin-management\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a7e9f7d0ef08191b97b213bb9e118ef\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a7e9f7d68608191bca9945146cbe6f1\",\"skill_name\":\"plugin-management\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-building\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-building\",\"title\":\"sites-building\",\"description\":\"Use Sites when the user wants a complete website built for them, such as a landing page, portfolio, dashboard, portal, tracker, hub, or internal tool, or wants to modify a website built with Sites. Do not use for development work in other web projects unless the user explicitly requests Sites.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6\",\"plugin_name\":\"sites\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6abae41befc8819181b1d85b56ed1208\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6abae41c28f88191ad7cd2d61d908fad\",\"skill_name\":\"sites-building\",\"contents\":[\"references\",\"templates\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-hosting\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-hosting\",\"title\":\"sites-hosting\",\"description\":\"Host websites with Sites. Use after `sites-building` to publish new sites and edits, for requested website publishing or deployment, or for hosting management. A project containing `.openai/hosting.json` uses Sites hosting only when the current request concerns that Site. Publishing an npm package or standalone asset is not website publishing. Honor an explicit request to use another hosting provider.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6\",\"plugin_name\":\"sites\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6abae41befc8819181b1d85b56ed1208\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6abae41c29008191b3bdbed58b3baaf2\",\"skill_name\":\"sites-hosting\",\"contents\":[\"scripts\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-mcp\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-mcp\",\"title\":\"sites-mcp\",\"description\":\"Build or update a Site-hosted MCP server and help users access its tools through the Site's plugin in ChatGPT or Codex.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6\",\"plugin_name\":\"sites\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6abae41befc8819181b1d85b56ed1208\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6abae41c290481919c88d29084e6dec2\",\"skill_name\":\"sites-mcp\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites-preview-troubleshooting\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979c